GPT-QModel legacy InternVL chat port

The wrapper, vision configuration and vision modeling originate from
OpenGVLab/InternVL under the MIT license retained in LICENSE. The separately
attributed FastChat-derived conversation implementation retains its Apache-2.0
license in LICENSE-FASTCHAT. Original source notices remain in those files.

InternVLTokenizerFactory is Copyright 2026 ModelCloud.ai, Apache-2.0.
It selects existing package/native implementations and does not contain a copy
of the InternLM2 tokenizer. That implementation and its source attribution live
in the sibling internlm and internlm2 port packages.

The tokenizer asset manifest records immutable Hugging Face release revisions
and SHA-256 hashes. The historical reference records Transformers 4.37.2
LlamaTokenizerFast output vectors. See README.md for source URLs, measured
parity, decoder/provider coverage and the explicit Tokenicer profile contract.
Downloaded checkpoint assets retain their upstream licenses; trained checkpoint
weights are not redistributed by this package.
